      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The range of housing options at Contra Costa College is diverse. The college understands the importance of providing a comfortable living environment that supports students academically. The on-campus housing facilities at Contra Costa College are designed to promote a cohesive community. The dormitories available are modern in appearance and equipped with essential amenities, including study areas, communal lounges, and high-speed internet access. The college also provides dedicated staff and resident advisors who are readily available to address any concerns or queries that students may have. Off-campus housing options near the college are also in abundance, with various rental apartments and houses within proximity.</p>",
